- active Business Field Catalogue.

## Workflow

1. Create a run ledger with `scripts/manage_a2_enrichment_run.py start`.
2. Translate the user's Company scope into allowlisted Twenty filters, then pull a bounded batch with `scripts/pull_twenty_companies.py`; claim only when live execution is approved. “Latest” means `createdAt[DescNullsLast]` unless the user specifies updated records instead.
3. When a verified official website exists and the Step 11 website gate is active, run the bounded Firecrawl skill before any FullEnrich action. Validate website contacts, socials and up to two People; prepare Company multi-value merges.
4. When a Company channel remains missing and an official-site Facebook URL exists, run the separately gated one-call/no-retry Apify Company-contact fallback.
5. Contact-enrich retained website People with missing channels, or continue the existing linked-Person Lookup and staged Search flow when the website is absent, blocked or insufficient.
6. If Owner yields no selection, resolve verified current A1-linked secondary People with zero provider Search calls. If one is selected, Contact Enrich and update that existing Twenty Person. Run paid secondary Search only when no linked secondary is selected. If no secondary is retained, use `completed_no_target`. Never advance automatically after a technical failure.
7. Contact-enrich up to two selected People from the successful stage for work email and phone only. Retain any syntactically valid FullEnrich work email with its exact provider status; `CATCH_ALL` and invalid statuses remain reviewable and do not alone satisfy verified named-email contactability.
8. Produce field decisions and build a Twenty write plan. Write each retained provider email with `emailStatus` as one governed Person operation.
9. Dry-run the write plan, then apply only when the run's write gate is active.
10. Reconcile read-back and finalise Company states.

## Credit controls

The controlled-pilot limits are 50 credits per run, 100 per UTC day and 250 total. Provider scripts reserve estimated maximum credits before paid calls and settle actual credits afterward. No spend approver or consumption owner is required. A cap failure stops the provider action without fallback.

## Boundaries

No direct A1 handoff, HubSpot, outreach or score mutation. Prospect website access must use the bounded Firecrawl skill rather than free-form `web_extract`. Apify is limited to the separately gated official-Facebook Company-contact action. Do not mark success without Twenty read-back. Persist every checkpoint so a run can resume without duplicate paid calls or People.